Package: insurancerating
Type: Package
Title: Actuarial Building Blocks for Insurance Pricing
Version: 0.8.2.9000
Authors@R: c(person("Martin", "Haringa", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "mtharinga@gmail.com"))
Author: Martin Haringa [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Martin Haringa <mtharinga@gmail.com>
BugReports: https://github.com/MHaringa/insurancerating/issues
Description: Provides actuarial building blocks for developing, interpreting,
    refining, and validating insurance pricing models and implementable tariffs.
    Complements statistical modelling in R with portfolio analysis, risk factor
    structuring, tariff adjustments, and model validation. Includes data-driven
    tariff segmentation based on the methodology of Antonio and Valdez (2012)
    <doi:10.1007/s10182-011-0152-7>.
